  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Support to the German led Border Project in Northen Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has carried out the scheduled training for 146 officers and NCO&apos;s, ending in their examination and subsequent graduation from the programme.
The project has recieved increased media coverage from Danish media during the past year, with local TV-station making a longer report about it. The report was also televised on national TV.
In the fall the activities related to the refurbishments of the training center in Ras Baalbek were commenced. The center is expected to be ready for use during the spring of 2014.
In November 2013, the planned review of the project was carried out and a report was submitted.</narrative>
  </description>
